MCP Router — access-controlled fork
===================================

This software is a MODIFIED version of MCP Router.

    Upstream project:  MCP Router, by fjm2u
                       https://github.com/mcp-router/mcp-router

This fork is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by the upstream
authors. Please do not report problems with this build to the upstream project.


Modifications in this fork
--------------------------

  - Per-key permissions on individual MCP servers and on individual tools
  - Cached tool lists, so permissions can be granted against a server that is
    currently powered off
  - Expiring Bearer keys, with a default lifetime of 30 days
  - A desktop administrator lock for the Electron window, which does not stop
    the HTTP gateway
  - A configurable white-label branding layer (see docs/BRANDING.md)

Everything else is upstream's work. The commit history preserves authorship
for every contributor.


